[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14941.83, "timestamp": "04:09:01", "text": "这很可疑。你看过《哈利·波特》吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14955.51, "timestamp": "04:09:15", "text": "等等，我选的是彩色眼睛吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14957.83, "timestamp": "04:09:17", "text": "颜色？让我查一下。教授，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14959.349, "timestamp": "04:09:19", "text": "她的卫兵佩戴的臂章是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14962.07, "timestamp": "04:09:22", "text": "闪闪发光。就像你看到的那种光芒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14965.349, "timestamp": "04:09:25", "text": "猪肉容器。不，更暗一些。我看到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14967.269, "timestamp": "04:09:27", "text": "龙的项圈上也散发着同样的光芒。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14968.87, "timestamp": "04:09:28", "text": "那是什么？我们只是好奇而已。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14971.429, "timestamp": "04:09:31", "text": "就是刚才那个高脚杯。他看着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14974.469, "timestamp": "04:09:34", "text": "在银行最古老的部分上方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14982.15, "timestamp": "04:09:42", "text": "我对虚伪了解不多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14983.99, "timestamp": "04:09:43", "text": "虽然，但是它真的很长很长"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14987.99, "timestamp": "04:09:47", "text": "距离我上次观看已经过去很久了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14998.87, "timestamp": "04:09:58", "text": "[音乐]"}]